    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"choose to stop\"... i don't even know what that looks like anymore. even when i'm not working, i'm just thinking about the work, or the responsibilities, or the person i'm supposed to be. it's like there's no way to just... turn it off. everything is so loud and heavy. i just want it to be quiet. i just want everything to finally be still.",
